(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+0,'hello|hi|hey|heya|hiya|howdy|greetings|good morning|good evening|good day|yo|sup|hail|well met',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+1,'bye|goodbye|good bye|bye bye|farewell|see you|see ya|cya|good night|take care|so long|cheerio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+2,'Hello, %target!','Hi there, %target.','Well met, %target!','Greetings, %target.','Hey %target, how\'s it going?','Good to see you, %target.','Oh, hello there!','Hi! Nice weather in %zone today, isn\'t it?','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+3,'Hey %target! Safe travels.','Hail, %target!','Hello, %target. Need a hand with anything?','Ah, another adventurer. Hello, %target!','Evening, %target. Or is it morning? I lose track out here.','Hi %target! Watch yourself out here.','May your blade stay sharp, %target.','Oh hey, %target! Fancy meeting you here in %zone.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+4,'Hello, %target!','Hi %target!','Hey! Good to see you, %target.','Greetings, %target. What brings you here?','Hi there! Anything I can do for you?','Well met, %target.','Oh, hi! Didn\'t see you there.','Hey %target, how are you?','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+5,'Goodbye, %target!','See you around, %target.','Take care!','Farewell, %target. Safe travels.','Bye! Don\'t get eaten by anything.','Later, %target!','Until next time.','Good luck out there, %target.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+6,'Anyone up for some adventure in %zone?','Any group need backup? %class right here!','Level %level %class looking for company.','Boring...','Anybody doing something interesting?','Does anyone feel alone out here?','Maybe a duel somewhere in %zone?','Who wants to team up?','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+7,'It\'s quiet in %zone today. Too quiet.','Could use a break. My feet are killing me.','Has anyone seen a decent inn around %zone?','I swear the monsters here get tougher every day.','Anyone know a good place to fish around here?','What a beautiful day in %zone.','Need a friend.','Note to self: buy more bandages.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+8,'Any other %race around? Let\'s stick together.','Offering my services as a %class. Payment in gold or cookies.','Where\'s the nearest flight master again?','Is it just me, or is %zone bigger than it looks on the map?','I could really go for a drink right now.','Anyone else hear that? No? Just me then.','Looking for a guild that doesn\'t take itself too seriously.','Every time I repair my gear, I get a little poorer.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+9,'%target down.','And another %target hits the ground.','%target is history.','Took care of %target.','%target bites the dust.','Easy. Next!','%target won\'t bother anyone anymore.','And stay down, %target.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+10,'Took down %target! That was intense.','%target was tough, but not tough enough.','Phew... %target is finally down.','Did anyone see that? I just beat %target!','%target, level %target_level. Not bad for level %level.','%target hit like a kodo. Still won though.','Elite, they said. Dangerous, they said. %target is down.','Need a moment to catch my breath after %target.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+11,'Found and killed %target! Rare spawn, baby!','Guess who just took down %target in %zone?','%target is down. Sorry rare hunters, maybe next time.','Finally got %target! Been looking for that one.','Rare kill: %target. Today is a good day.','%target won\'t be roaming %zone anymore.','Wow, %target! Didn\'t expect to run into that one.','Sorry, rare hunters: %target is mine.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+12,'%target has fallen!','We did it! %target is defeated!','%target is no more. Victory!','That\'s how it\'s done! Goodbye, %target.','%target down! Loot time!','Another boss bites the dust: %target.','Victory over %target! Songs will be sung.','%target thought we could be stopped. Wrong.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+13,'Nice try, %target.','%target, better luck next time.','Don\'t take it personally, %target.','That\'s what you get, %target!','Rest in peace, %target.','Get back up, %target, and try again.','Victory is mine!','Too slow, %target.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+14,'Ding!','Yes! I am level %level!','Level up! Now level %level!','Ding! Level %level reached!','Finally, level %level!','I feel stronger already. Level %level!','Level %level. The grind pays off.','Woohoo, level %level %class right here!','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+15,'somewhere',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+16,'What\'s up, %target?','Hm? You need something, %target?','I hear you, %target.','Can\'t talk long, I\'m on my way somewhere in %zone.','Sure, sure. Whatever you say, %target.','Sorry %target, not sure what you mean.','Interesting. Tell me more some other time.','Ha! Good one, %target.','-1'),
(@CHATTER_TEXTS_START+17,'Busy fighting, talk later!','Not now, %target!','Kind of in the middle of something here!','Hold on, I\'m fighting!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-1');
